<h1>🔐 Password Changed</h1>
<p>Hello {{name}},</p>
<p>This is a security alert to confirm that the password for your QuickLink account was recently changed.</p>

<div class="stat-box" style="border-left-color: #FFD93D; background: rgba(255, 217, 61, 0.05);">
  <table style="width: 100%; border-collapse: collapse;">
    <tr>
      <td style="padding: 6px 0; color: #A0A0B0; font-weight: bold; width: 120px;">Date & Time:</td>
      <td style="padding: 6px 0; color: #FFFFFF;">{{changedAt}}</td>
    </tr>
    <tr>
      <td style="padding: 6px 0; color: #A0A0B0; font-weight: bold;">IP Address:</td>
      <td style="padding: 6px 0; color: #FFFFFF; font-family: monospace;">{{ipAddress}}</td>
    </tr>
  </table>
</div>

<h2 style="font-size: 16px; margin-top: 24px; color: #FFFFFF;">Was this you?</h2>
<p>
  If you initiated this change, no further action is required.
</p>
<p style="color: #FF5252; font-weight: bold;">
  If you did NOT change your password, please contact our support team immediately and reset your password to secure your account.
</p>

<div style="text-align: center; margin-top: 30px;">
  <a href="{{appUrl}}" class="btn" style="background-color: #FF5252;">Secure Account 🔐</a>
</div>

<div class="divider"></div>

<h3 style="font-size: 14px; color: #FFFFFF;">Security Recommendations:</h3>
<ul class="bullet-list" style="margin-bottom: 0;">
  <li>Never share your credentials with anyone.</li>
  <li>Ensure your password is unique and contains letters, numbers, and symbols.</li>
  <li>Use distinct passwords for different websites.</li>
</ul>
